abstract: >-
  A portable, evidence-grounded Agent Skill and project-control framework that
  teaches general-purpose AI agents to diagnose, prioritize, steer, evaluate and
  replan long-running research and engineering projects under human supervision,
  inspired by Engineering Cybernetics.
